{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the World of <i>Chain-Chillas</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a traditional marble\u00a0rolling game, where your\u00a0objective\u00a0is\u00a0to roll your way to the\u00a0end\u00a0of each stage. However, there's just one catch:\u00a0you\u00a0have\u00a0to\u00a0do\u00a0it all while attached to\u00a0a\u00a0giant\u00a0ball\u00a0and\u00a0chain! Collect coins, reach the goal, and roll your\u00a0way\u00a0through 80+ stages of\u00a0increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/d8acda1c1ddd3cbadb06f70e062db408.poster.avif?t=1765182815\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/d8acda1c1ddd3cbadb06f70e062db408.webm?t=1765182815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/d8acda1c1ddd3cbadb06f70e062db408.mp4?t=1765182815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll Alone or Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play by yourself, tied to a giant ball and chain, or play online, chained to up to 3 of your friends! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Waddle and Roll, Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 different styles of play, including Challenge Mode, Race, and Free Play. Stages are split across different courses, designed for players of varying skill levels. Complete courses to unlock new cosmetics\u00a0and\u00a0customize\u00a0your own penguin!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fully Simulated Ball and Chain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ball and chain isn't just dead weight: it interacts with the world, too! Use it to zipline across tight platforms and cross otherwise impossible obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/40517bb0ec31b37e7925ae33bbbc4b10.poster.avif?t=1765182815\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/40517bb0ec31b37e7925ae33bbbc4b10.webm?t=1765182815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/40517bb0ec31b37e7925ae33bbbc4b10.mp4?t=1765182815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593660?t=1765182815","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593660?t=1765182815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/406ab33cffa9b04050138c0ae2a8fd94d1a5a233/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765182815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/406ab33cffa9b04050138c0ae2a8fd94d1a5a233/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765182815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3593730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the World of <i>Chain-Chillas</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a traditional marble\u00a0rolling game, where your\u00a0objective\u00a0is\u00a0to roll your way to the\u00a0end\u00a0of each stage. However, there's just one catch:\u00a0you\u00a0have\u00a0to\u00a0do\u00a0it all while attached to\u00a0a\u00a0giant\u00a0ball\u00a0and\u00a0chain! Collect coins, reach the goal, and roll your\u00a0way\u00a0through 80+ stages of\u00a0increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/d8acda1c1ddd3cbadb06f70e062db408.poster.avif?t=1765182815\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/d8acda1c1ddd3cbadb06f70e062db408.webm?t=1765182815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/d8acda1c1ddd3cbadb06f70e062db408.mp4?t=1765182815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll Alone or Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play by yourself, tied to a giant ball and chain, or play online, chained to up to 3 of your friends! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Waddle and Roll, Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 different styles of play, including Challenge Mode, Race, and Free Play. Stages are split across different courses, designed for players of varying skill levels. Complete courses to unlock new cosmetics\u00a0and\u00a0customize\u00a0your own penguin!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fully Simulated Ball and Chain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ball and chain isn't just dead weight: it interacts with the world, too! Use it to zipline across tight platforms and cross otherwise impossible obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593660/extras/40517bb0ec31b37e7925ae33bbbc4b10.poster.avif?t=1765182815\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com